    <string name="how_to_play_title">How to play</string>
    <string name="how_to_play_step_1">Choose a challenge, then set your formation, difficulty, era and extras.</string>
    <string name="how_to_play_step_2">Squad first: each spin lands on a real squad from the past and you draft one player. Position first: pick a slot, then spin for it.</string>
    <string name="how_to_play_step_3">Stuck with a squad? Easy gives you 3 re-spins, Normal 1, Hard none.</string>
    <string name="how_to_play_step_4">Players from the same club or nation add chemistry, which lifts your whole team.</string>
    <string name="how_to_play_step_5">Appoint a gaffer, survive the January window and win every match for a perfect run.</string>
